          "rule_version": "SRG-APP-000166-CTR-000410",
          "rule_title": "The container platform must enforce password complexity by requiring that at least one uppercase character be used.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the container platform to enforce password complexity by requiring that at least one uppercase character be used.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Review the container platform configuration to determine if it enforces password complexity by requiring that at least one uppercase character be used. \n\nIf the container platform does not enforce password complexity by requiring that at least one uppercase character be used, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
