          "fix_text": "Configure the container platform to notify system administrators and ISSO when accounts are disabled.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Review the container platform configuration to determine if system administrators and ISSO are notified when accounts are disabled. \n\nIf system administrators and ISSO are not notified, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
