          "rule_version": "SRG-APP-000442-CTR-001095",
          "rule_title": "The container platform must maintain the confidentiality and integrity of information during reception.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the container platform to maintain the confidentiality and integrity using mechanisms such as TLS, TLS VPNs, or IPsec during reception.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Review documentation and configuration settings to determine if the container platform maintains the confidentiality and integrity of information during reception.\n\nIf confidentiality and integrity are not maintained using mechanisms such as TLS, TLS VPNs, or IPsec during reception, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
