          "discussion": "Unauthorized users modify level the security levels to exploit vulnerabilities within the container platform component. All the components must use the same standard so that the events can be tied together to understand what took place within the overall container platform. This must establish, correlate, and help assist with investigating the events relating to an incident, or identify those responsible.\n\nWithout audit record generation, unauthorized users can access delete security objects unknowingly for malicious intent creating vulnerabilities within the container platform.",
