          "classification": "Unclassified",
          "discussion": "Direct access to the container platform and its components must generate audit records. All the components must use the same standard so that the events can be tied together to understand what took place within the overall container platform. This must establish, correlate, and help assist with investigating the events relating to an incident, or identify those responsible.",
